+//   - ifu_arvalid_dbg: the earliest point in the whole chain - the fetch
+//     unit's own AXI ARVALID output, before it even reaches the BIU/SCU.
+//   - scu_ext_ar_valid_dbg: the L2 SCU's ACE master arbiter's own AR-valid
+//     output, mid-chain, gated by clean_aclken_dbg below.
+//   - clean_aclken_dbg: the clock-enable gating the SCU arbiter's advance
