+// 2026-10-12 (build 43): after the build 42 banner the CPU issued no AXI
+// transaction for the rest of each 10 s window. These taps say whether it is
+// waiting on the bus or stalled internally:
+//   dbg_rd_outstanding  level: CPU AR accepted, last R beat not yet returned
+//   dbg_wr_outstanding  level: CPU AW accepted, B not yet returned
