+// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Debug taps: NIC-400 interconnect ingress/egress, bracketing the entire
+// A53->ROM crossbar path. cpu_axi_arvalid_dbg above confirmed the CPU does
+// issue a real ARVALID that never reaches ROM_wrapper's slave port - these
+// two taps narrow down where inside the interconnect it disappears. The
+// A53 ASIB's output enters bus matrix bm2 first (arvalid_a53_bm2_axi_s_0,
+// = u_asib_A53's arvalid_A53_m); the request then crosses into bus matrix
